# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files regardless of the checkout
# platform's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows core.autocrlf=true
# silently rewrites LF blobs to CRLF on every fresh checkout/branch/worktree,
# which breaks any raw-bytes SHA-256 check (frozen security contracts, plan
# approval records) with zero real content change. A small, enumerated set of
# preserved A2A audit records below is exempt via `-text` to protect their raw
# bytes (deliberate CRLF and intentional Markdown hard breaks); every other
# text file in this repository remains LF-only, so this is a no-op for all
# other existing content and only prevents future drift there.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary; skip line-ending normalization and text diffing.
*.pdf binary

